&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Roboyo&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;is a category shaper in Applied AI and Agentic Automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We help leading enterprises move from automation projects and AI experiments into governed, production-grade systems that execute real work across workflows, processes,&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our heritage is in scaled enterprise automation; our future is&amp;nbsp;Applied AI and&amp;nbsp;Agentic&amp;nbsp;Automation: autonomous agents, AI engineering squads, process orchestration, data and knowledge foundations, and human-in-the-loop governance embedded deeply into how our clients&amp;nbsp;operate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are not here to sell AI theatre. We are here to turn AI into&amp;nbsp;working systems, measurable&amp;nbsp;outcomes&amp;nbsp;and repeatable transformation programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Global Service Line Lead,&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;ll spearhead Sales, Delivery, and Enablement initiatives, serving as the go-to authority within Roboyo on priorities and operational strategies for your practice. You will collaborate closely with the Senior Leadership team to elevate our performance and drive innovation in the ever-evolving landscape of Agentic Automation Engineering, which at its core is the engineering discipline focused on designing and building an organization’s execution fabric.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Collaborate with other Global Service Line Leads and CBOs to cohesively integrate the service offerings incorporating all elements from your service line&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Develop and communicate a strategic vision for the practice, integrate your service line with Roboyo’s strategy to adopt AI accelerated services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Serve as an external-facing ambassador for the Roboyo brand, promoting specific IP and thought leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Channel and integrate requests from other parts of the organization into the Service Line (such as Delivery, Sales, HR or IT)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Escalate critical issues and risks concerning your practice to the C-level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Go-to Market:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Maintain “offer shelf” aligned to the AI &amp;amp; Agentic pivot (Offering decks, demos, accelerators, reference architectures, pricing guidance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Intervene directly in pre-sales for high-stakes or highly innovative situations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Be the gatekeeper for sales/margin and project governance in larger Agentic Automation Engineering proposals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Act as single point of contact for Partner relationship management on global topics for UI Path + Other vendors focused on automation – e.g. n8n – (product strategy, go-to-market &amp;amp; pricing strategy)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovation and Intellectual Property:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Integrate market inputs and client context to define new propositions: develop and enhance the practice’s offering materials and packages for Sales and GTM activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Mobilize resources for global initiatives/internal projects to turn best-in-class delivery artefacts into assets/IP used as delivery accelerators or function/industry specific proof points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Translate advancements in technology into differentiators for our clients as well as our own people (e.g. vibe coding, automated test/QA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Structure and Nurture Competencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Lead a community to foster and promote best practice and knowledge sharing across regions, ensuring high quality assurance in our internal team enablement including L&amp;amp;D program development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Anchor formal and informal upskilling pathways for and maintain certification depth of our automation engineering team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Support global demand and capacity planning for your service line including proactive “bench-time offering”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Provide constructive feedback on the individual contributions to your global practices as part of our careers framework, acting as tollgate for key hires and promotions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Strong background in Automation Engineering utilizing agentic automation platforms i.e UI Path, PowerAutomate, n8n. Additional experience in Test Automation is preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Proven track record in running and driving practices/service lines in a Professional Services company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Strong commercial awareness with a track record of sales and pre-sales engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Proven track record in leading development projects with CICD/SDLC/Agile principles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Demonstrable experience in developing AI led strategy solutions and adoption, focused on tangible client outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Experience in Product and Solution development in aligned Industry verticals and/or business functions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Is High-Energy and Driven: Demonstrates a “can-do” attitude, focusing on solutions rather than problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Is a Strong Team Player: Shows evidence of impactful contributions in both small and large team settings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Has Influencing Skills: Can demonstrate the ability to influence others through a variety of mechanisms to achieve common goals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Has C-Level Experience: Proven track record of working effectively with C-level executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Is a Strategic Planner: Can formulate and operate detailed work plans with clear milestones and deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Understands Business Cases: Has experience constructing and understanding business cases, including knowledge of different value drivers and can articulate that value from a business rather than technical perspective&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Native or C2 proficiency in English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Willingness to travel as required&lt;/p&gt;
